# Unscode website

Marketing / landing site for **Unscode** (software development). Default UI language and `html` locale are Portuguese (`pt-br`); match existing copy tone when editing content.

## Stack

- **Next.js** (App Router) under `src/app/`
- **React 18** and **TypeScript** (`strict` in `tsconfig.json`)
- **Tailwind CSS** for styling (`tailwind.config.js`, `globals.css`)
- Path alias: `@/*` → `./src/*` (prefer `@/` for imports from `src`)

## Repository layout

- `src/app/` — routes, `layout.tsx`, `page.tsx`, `globals.css`, assets, components
- Shared UI lives under `src/app/components/` (e.g. icons in `components/icons/`)
- Root config: `next.config.js`, `postcss.config.js`, `tailwind.config.js`, `.eslintrc.json`

## How to change the codebase

- Keep edits scoped to the task; avoid unrelated refactors or new docs unless requested.
- Follow patterns already in the file you touch (quotes, component style, Tailwind class style).
- Run `npm run lint` after substantive changes when relevant.
